OL,3,GNEWSATown ranked among best in England
OL,4,Ato grow old
OL,5,
OL,6,FWokingham has been named among the best
OL,7,Fplaces in the country to grow old.
OL,9,FThe Berkshire town was ranked fourth
OL,10,Fnationally and fourth in the South East
OL,11,Fin a new study.
OL,13,FResearch conducted by Lovett Care, a
OL,14,Fcare home operator, assessed 294 local
OL,15,Fauthority districts in England, scoring
OL,16,Fthem on health, social care, transport,
OL,17,Fhousing costs, environment and
OL,18,Fcommunity wellbeing.
OL,20,FWokingham scored 86.5 out of 100,
OL,21,Fbehind Mole Valley, West Oxfordshire
OL,22,Fand Surrey Heath.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
